<title>USA: U.S. TREASURY BALANCES AT FED ROSE ON AUG 6.</title>
<headline>U.S. TREASURY BALANCES AT FED ROSE ON AUG 6.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				   Aug 6		  Aug 5</p>
<p>Fed acct			 5.947		  5.100</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  10.598		 10.415</p>
<p>Cash balance		  16.545		 15.515</p>
<p>	  ---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,286.657	     5,288.262</p>
